# No frontend-wide active-block tracking flag.
# This model's worker set advertises `router_track_active_blocks` on the model
# card itself: the hosted SGLang workers via router/<model>/hosted.args and the
# proxies via their configs' `router_config`. The card checksum includes
# `router_config`, so all workers in the set advertise identical values and stay
# one worker set.
#
# A frontend-wide DYN_ROUTER_TRACK_ACTIVE_BLOCKS=true (equivalently
# --router-track-active-blocks) also works but changes tracking for every other
# model on the frontend, which is why this deployment does not rely on it.
#
# The models below use the dw-spillover policy and set tracking per worker set:
#   - zai-org/GLM-5.3@interactive
#   - zai-org/GLM-5.3@throughput
